nnot* be a matrix of a quadratic form defined on ${R}^{4}.$ Although it's a $4\\times 4$ matrix, $D$ is not symmetric since ${d}_{24}\\ne {d}_{42}.$\n\n- $E$ *cannot* be a matrix of a quadratic form defined on ${R}^{4}$ since it's a $2\\times 2$ matrix (not $4\\times 4$).\n\n- $F$ could be a matrix of a quadratic form defined on ${R}^{4}$ since it is a $4\\times 4$ symmetric matrix.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$F$ only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-94063/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e62e458d-0724-5dbe-b448-b79404f279f9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94063"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-140870/selection/27ead39b22315899a97d19d41807fad901038aea957324f0c89ba36f126544db" :answer/id #uuid "4809d6b8-54c2-5c32-a52e-c040650c79a9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$T$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140870/selection/5572e02e27f0cbc239ccd93fb0f30c843c05a3432e80728a1f2acd6bf56149c0" :answer/id #uuid "00a531bf-e7a8-5a50-8c7f-fd27d0459d42" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$S$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140870/selection/78c99b048c073112d2268b9a0e6ff9be35e9c88b5af116dbd6b93d23fa650677" :answer/id #uuid "4c1f5581-f82a-568c-b69d-7cddc35596a2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$S$ and $T$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140870/selection/820282211c30a20e021a66f68b7464203ed7fe571ec86a81ae83e0d42d754f2c" :answer/id #uuid "088302bb-c647-5b28-9c14-bffb3a522f77" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$R$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140870/selection/7cb66002ef0e4e067fcef0990f7e6ba64bc71a98fe75cca083e387f3baef331d" :answer/id #uuid "56bf286f-55b5-5d08-b06f-f523de6e25ba" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$R$ and $S$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140870/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1054e6d5-cbf9-530b-89b1-b4ff3