7596" :question/math-academy-id "q-94069" :question/problem "Consider the quadratic form \n$Q(x)={x}_{1}^{2}+4{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{3}+2{x}_{2}^{2}-2{x}_{2}{x}_{3}+{x}_{3}^{2}.$ \nEvaluate $Q(x)$ when $x=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "We are given that \n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the expression for $Q(x)$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Q(x) & ={x}_{1}^{2}+4{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{3}+2{x}_{2}^{2}-2{x}_{2}{x}_{3}+{x}_{3}^{2} \\\\  & =(-1)^{2}+4\\cdot (-1)\\cdot 0+2\\cdot (-1)\\cdot (-2)+2\\cdot {0}^{2}-2\\cdot 0\\cdot (-2)+(-2)^{2} \\\\  & =1+0+4+0-0+4 \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-94069/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "90f62dc8-396d-5f7f-8295-2e7b5d62bd78"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94069"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-94068/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "3491a842-78d4-5bf4-87cf-0ae7ff36be4f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94068/selection/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666" :answer/id #uuid "7f830fb4-c3f2-5ce8-95de-cd5f0a0f2150" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94068/selection/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" :answer/id #uuid "7d3a7cb3-0613-5182-be9b-51807c8a0aaa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94068/selection/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "9e1b129d-7f3c-5973-ae02-0c76d2d8b8c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94068/sele